  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Kosharskoye. Hind (1992: 92) suggests that an archaeological site of some 4 hectares at\u00a0<span>Kosharskoye</span> on the right bank of the Tiiligul estuary may correspond to ancient <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/229574\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Ordessos</a>.</p>",
